"notes": "No bracketed old names seen. Gutter overlap with 22-31R (R x ~ L x - 5550): Clara/Northside, Clara/Orange, Felton/Orange, Orange/Lehman Road. Selim Avenue lies at L x ~6150-6190, right at the cut edge; its crossings are left to 22-31R. Unnamed (?): street WSW off Quebec north of Westwood (4in W. pipe); short street north off Queen City at x~3680; the N-S street west of Mt. Harrison printed only 'STREET' (Schoedinger's SW continuation turns into it; it jogs east at y~5755 and runs to Liberty). 'Uerman Street' read as UERMAN, first letter partly hidden by a dimension. Thinnes is the lower of the two parallel streets west of Quebec. Shadwell's line continues south of Guernsey labelled WAYLAND; Guernsey junction recorded as Shadwell, Orange junction as Wayland. Orange Street's south section (to Lehman Road) is printed 'STREET' only; ORANGE label is on the bending part above. Esmonde jogs ~135 px at Shadwell; Seegar jogs ~15 px at Westwood; Northside jogs ~25 px at Van Hart. Grand Avenue begins at Jonte (no street north of it)."
